{"a":[35,35],"h":"<p>şöyle ki 35.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"91\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 90.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 33.0 50.3 60.7 67.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.0 50.3 67.6 74.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ya rab! dedi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"90\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 90.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 35.2 44.2 44.2 51.7 51.7 58.4 58.4 67.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"74.2\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bana mağrifet buyur - her ne kusur, hata sâdır oldu ise afv-ü kereminle ört<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"135\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 135.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 35.2 35.2 42.0 42.0 57.7 69.0 69.0 85.4 85.4 102.0 111.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"102.0 111.0 119.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bana öyle bir mülk bağışla ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"196\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 196.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 30.0 30.0 39.0 39.0 45.7 61.4 61.4 72.0 72.0 87.7 87.7 96.7 108.7 113.2 129.7 141.0 141.0 147.7 154.4 154.4 161.2 168.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.7 96.7 108.7 147.7 161.2 172.4 180.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> benden başka kimseye gerekmesin - ya'ni benim halime münasib, münasib bana mahsus bir mu'cize olsun, yâhud bu kerre olduğu gibi kimse onu benden selb-ü nezı edemesin. Yukarılarda da geçtiği üzere Razî tefsîrinin bir yerinde buna şöyle de ma'nâ vermiştir: Ya'ni bana öyle şanlı bir mülk ver ki ben ona nâil olup öldükten sonra Dünya mülkünün vefası olsa idi Süleymana olurdu denilsin de kimsenin Dünya mülküne hırs-u rağbeti yaraşık almasın.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 28.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> . Bu da güzel bir mazmundur. Fakat biz öyle anlıyoruz ki Süleyman aleyhisselâmın asıl maksadı fâni olan Dünya mülkü değil Âhıret mülkünü istemektir. Zira «</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"433\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 433.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 18.7 18.7 26.2 26.2 42.0 52.4 59.2 79.4 79.4 90.0 96.7 114.0 114.0 114.0 120.7 120.7 127.4 127.4 135.0 156.0 167.2 167.2 183.0 183.0 189.7 206.2 206.2 213.7 213.7 221.2 237.0 237.0 243.7 251.2 263.2 263.2 267.7 275.2 291.0 307.4 307.4 315.0 336.0 336.0 345.0 351.7 351.7 359.2 359.2 375.0 385.4 392.2 412.4 412.4 423.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.0 59.2 90.0 96.7 135.0 189.7 221.2 243.7 251.2 291.0 315.0 375.0 392.2 423.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"375\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 374.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.4 26.2 26.2 40.4 56.2 56.2 66.7 66.7 82.4 82.4 89.2 96.7 108.7 108.7 113.2 120.7 136.4 147.7 147.7 163.4 163.4 170.2 177.7 184.4 191.2 208.4 215.2 223.4 223.4 230.2 230.2 246.0 246.0 252.7 252.7 259.4 259.4 259.4 267.7 267.7 283.4 290.2 297.0 297.0 303.7 303.7 303.7 312.7 320.2 336.0 352.4 352.4 360.0\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 2